 "remarks": "In one of the most desirable neighborhoods in the town of Norwalk. You will find this wonderful gem that requires very minimal maintenance. A dream location for you daily commuters with placement right in between RT8 and RT1 and being just an ear shot away from Westport and the Birchwood Country club this one has the perfect location for almost any sort of lifestyle that you might prefer. This no outlet neighborhood is great for those who prefer a bit of a more secluded neighborhood. Aswell as one of the highest rated school systems. This Single level Ranch is equipped with Central AC. A large corner lot that is very flexible in usage. This is a perfect fit for those looking to start a family or those who are sick of a big house that comes with big maintenance bills. With 3 Beds that all have comfortable space. A full bathroom with a beautiful Jacuzzi Tub and a stand-up shower for options. No worries there will be no need to fight over the bathroom in the mornings as this home also comes with a half bathroom. A subway style kitchen with dining space towards the end. The living room has a 9FT + ceiling that has more than enough space for company and walks out to the deck. Last but not least the Mechanicals are in need of absolutely no touches. Hurry and place your showing as soon as possible folks this one is a charming keeper!",
